# Favorite Toggle & HTML Preview Implementation Scratchpad

## 🔍 Analysis First:

### Understanding the Task Goal:
1. **Fix favorite toggle not working and not updating table**: The favorite toggle in HomeFragment is not properly saving to database or syncing with backend
2. **Implement HTML preview rendering**: When template type is HTML, show live HTML/CSS/JS preview in item_template.xml instead of just static image preview on HomeFragment

### Linked/Related Files Working Together:
1. **HomeFragment.java** - Main UI component with template list and favorite toggle handling
2. **TemplateAdapter.java** - RecyclerView adapter handling favorite click events and UI updates
3. **HomeViewModel.java** - ViewModel managing template interactions and repository calls
4. **TemplateRepository.java** - Repository handling favorite toggle API calls and local storage
5. **Template.java** - Data model with HTML/CSS/JS content fields and favorite state
6. **item_template.xml** - Layout file with favorite button and content display containers
7. **backend/routes/users/templates.js** - Backend API routes for favorite operations
8. **ApiService.java** - API interface for favorite toggle network calls
9. **TemplateRenderer.java** - Existing HTML rendering utility for WebView

### Key References and Import Analysis:
- **HomeFragment**: Implements `OnTemplateInteractionListener.onTemplateFavorited()` callback
- **TemplateAdapter**: Calls `onTemplateInteractionListener.onTemplateFavorited(template, newFavoritedState)` 
- **HomeViewModel**: Has `handleTemplateFavorite()` method calling `repository.toggleFavorite()`
- **TemplateRepository**: Has `toggleFavorite()` method with API calls and local storage
- **Template**: Has `htmlContent`, `cssContent`, `jsContent` fields for HTML templates
- **Backend**: PUT `/api/users/:uid/favorites/:templateId` and DELETE routes for favorites
- **Layout**: Has `html_template_container` for HTML display and `template_image` for images

## 📝 Scratchpad Plan:

### 🎯 Objective 
1. Fix favorite toggle functionality to properly save to database and sync with backend
2. Implement live HTML/CSS/JS preview rendering in HomeFragment template cards for HTML type templates

### 🧩 Related Files
- **app/src/main/java/com/ds/eventwish/ui/home/HomeFragment.java** (favorite callback handling)
- **app/src/main/java/com/ds/eventwish/ui/adapter/TemplateAdapter.java** (favorite toggle UI and callback)
- **app/src/main/java/com/ds/eventwish/ui/home/HomeViewModel.java** (favorite business logic)
- **app/src/main/java/com/ds/eventwish/data/repository/TemplateRepository.java** (favorite API calls)
- **app/src/main/java/com/ds/eventwish/data/model/Template.java** (HTML content fields)
- **app/src/main/res/layout/item_template.xml** (HTML preview container)
- **app/src/main/java/com/ds/eventwish/ui/render/TemplateRenderer.java** (HTML rendering utility)
- **backend/routes/users/templates.js** (favorite API endpoints)

### ✅ Checklist
- [x] **Analyze favorite toggle issue**:
  - [x] Check HomeFragment.onTemplateFavorited() implementation
  - [x] Verify TemplateAdapter favorite click handling
  - [x] Check HomeViewModel.handleTemplateFavorite() logic
  - [x] Verify TemplateRepository.toggleFavorite() API calls
  - [x] Check backend favorite routes functionality
  - [x] Identify root cause of database not updating
- [x] **Fix favorite toggle functionality**:
  - [x] Fix any broken API calls or response handling
  - [x] Ensure proper error handling and retry logic
  - [x] Fix local database updates and sync
  - [x] Add proper logging for debugging
  - [x] Test favorite toggle end-to-end
- [x] **Implement HTML preview in HomeFragment**:
  - [x] Create WebView-based HTML preview component for item_template.xml
  - [x] Add HTML content rendering logic to TemplateAdapter
  - [x] Implement proper error handling for HTML rendering failures
  - [x] Add null checks for HTML/CSS/JS content
  - [x] Ensure rendering happens on background thread to avoid main thread blocking
  - [x] Add fallback to image preview when HTML content is missing
  - [x] Implement proper WebView security settings
